OL,3,GNEWSACalls for new 20mph zone after man
OL,4,Akilled and two arrested                
OL,6,FCouncillors have called for a busy main
OL,7,Froad in Liverpool to be made a 20mph   
OL,8,Fzone before "more lives are put at     
OL,9,Frisk" after a man was hit and killed by
OL,10,Fa car.                                 
OL,12,FThe man, 53, was pronounced dead at the
OL,13,Fscene following a two-car crash at the 
OL,14,Fjunction between Smithdown Road and    
OL,15,FGreenbank Road on 19 November.         
OL,17,FFollowing the incident, a man from     
OL,18,FWoolton, 38, was arrested on suspicion 
OL,19,Fof causing death by dangerous driving. 
OL,20,FA second man, 53, was also arrested on 
OL,21,Fsuspicion of causing death by drug     
OL,22,Fdriving.                               
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
