OL,3,GNEWSACalls for new 20mph zone after man
OL,4,Akilled and two arrested                
OL,6,FGreen Party members in Liverpool have  
OL,7,Fnow urged Liverpool City Council to    
OL,8,Freduce the speed limit along Smithdown 
OL,9,FRoad, which is currently a 30mph zone, 
OL,10,Falong with pedestrian crossing         
OL,11,Fupgrades.                              
